// boss_fight's HeroHeal — single-target ally Heal(25.0). First Heal
// EffectOp in this fixture; proves the apply_ability dispatcher emits
// kind=27 EffectHealApplied chronicle records via the fused
// `physics_ApplyDamageFromChronicle_and_ApplyStunFromChronicle_and_ApplyHealFromChronicle`
// kernel.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: false },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 50.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Heal { amount: 25.0 }] }.
//
// `target: ally` flips `hostile_only` to `false`; the .sim's score
// expression picks Hero allies via `target.creature_type == Hero &&
// target != self`. `range: 50` is wide single-target metadata (boss_fight
// scores per-pair argmax with no spatial filter).

ability HeroHeal {
    target: ally
    range: 50
    cooldown: 0

    heal 25
}
